<title>INDIA: State Bank of India appoints deputy managing director.</title>
<headline>State Bank of India appoints deputy managing director.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bank of India said on Thursday it had appointed K.Govindan as deputy managing director, international banking, at its central office.</p>
<p>Govindan was chief executive officer and country manager at New York before this appointment, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
